# 3) ENV & MinIO (für die Rules)

`.env.local` (nur Server):

```
MINIO_ENDPOINT=http://localhost:9000
MINIO_REGION=us-east-1
MINIO_ACCESS_KEY=xxxxx
MINIO_SECRET_KEY=yyyyy
MINIO_BUCKET=hochzeit-fotos
UPLOAD_MAX_MB=25
UPLOAD_ALLOWED_MIME=image/jpeg,image/png,image/heic,image/heif
EVENT_CODE=2025
```

**MinIO CORS** (ersetze Origin mit deiner Domain):

```json
[
  {
    "AllowedOrigin": ["https://deine-domain.tld", "http://localhost:3000"],
    "AllowedMethod": ["PUT", "POST", "GET"],
    "AllowedHeader": ["*"],
    "ExposeHeader": ["ETag", "Location"],
    "MaxAgeSeconds": 3000
  }
]
```

**Bucket-Policy** (privat; nur presigned erlaubt):

```json
{
  "Version":"2012-10-17",
  "Statement":[
    {
      "Effect":"Deny",
      "Principal":"*",
      "Action":"s3:*",
      "Resource":[
        "arn:aws:s3:::hochzeit-fotos",
        "arn:aws:s3:::hochzeit-fotos/*"
      ],
      "Condition":{"Bool":{"aws:SecureTransport":"false"}}
    }
  ]
}
```

